    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maguta na migatī kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Balagīlage a Baisilaeli bakwenhele maguta gawiza ga mizeituni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maguta gawiza ga mizeituni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maguta gakakamagwa kūfuma mu mbegu ja mizeituni, gīt'ūmo gakakamīlagwa ga ng'halanga nūūlū ga būlūba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ga kūtūmamīla mu tala, jiyūbaka būlī makanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alooni akūyūjibeegeleja ī tala, ī hanze y'itundubaali l'isenge lya ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, īlo līshīkīgije isandīko lya būkaanīji; nguno shiigelile jibake kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA būlī lūshikū, kwandīja mhīndī kūshisha ntondo yaho dilū. Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha kūshinga ho shikū jose, pyī ū mu shibyalīlwe shing'we īsho shiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī tala jenījo jidīlīlwe chiza aho jilī a h'ikīndīkīlo lya tala lya zahabu, jiyūbachiwa būlī lūshikū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hanuma ūkūsola būsu būnogu ūbeeje migatī ikūmi n'ībīlī; būlī kilo ibīlī ja būsu ngatī gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī migatī yenīyo ūkwīhela ng'hīlīlī ibīlī kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, a ha meeza ya zahabu yawiza; būlī lūhīlīlī migatī ītandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūkūtūūla na būbbani wawiza a ha būlī lūhīlīlī, būbize shakwinha sha kūpemva a ha ng'wanya gwa migatī yenīyo; sha kūfunyiwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA kūlwa shiizūkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī lūshikū lwa Sabato, ī migatī yenīyo īkūyūfunyiwa kūlwa Baisilaeli a bose, yatūūlwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. Ī lyenīlī līkūbiza ilagane lya shikū jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī migatī yenīyo īkūbiza ya ng'wa Alooni na bitūnja bakwe, ya kūlya balī ng'wipandī lyeela, nguno īlī myeela no no no; gūlī ngabo gwabo gwa būlī lūshikū, kūfuma mu shitambò sha kūpemva īsho shikafunyiagwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango kūlwa būsondagūji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nsūmba nebe, ng'witūnja wa nkīma Ng'wisilaeli, ū ise walī muna Misili, lwise lūmò aho alī hamò na Baisilaeli mu ng'hambī, akikenya na ngosha ūmò Ng'wisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja wa Ng'wisilaeli ng'wenūyo witagūla mihayo misoso ya kūlīsondagūla ī lina lya ng'wa SEEBA; būndima būntwala kūlī Musa. (Ū nina witanagwa Shelomitī ng'wana Diibīli, wa lūganda lwa Dani). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo būnugalīla hanhū, kūshisha ū SEEBA aboolekeje hape ū gwa kūng'wītīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nfunyagi muntwale hanze ya ng'hambī ū nsondagūji, abo baang'wigwile batūūle makono gabo a ha ntwe gwakwe. Hūna pye a Baisilaeli bamponde mawe, ache. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo bawīlage a Baisilaeli gīkī, ‘Ose ose ūyo ūlīsondagūla lina lya ng'wa Mulungu wakwe, akwingīla mu kwihīga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ū wa kūlīsondagūla ī lina lya ng'wa SEEBA shiigelile abūlagwe. Nūūlū abize ng'wana byalwa ū mu sī ya Isilaeli, nūūlū ngeni, ūlū ūlinda ūlīsondagūla ī Lina, shiigelile abūlagwe; pye a banhū bakūmponda mawe.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nūūlū munhū ūntūla munhū kūshisha ūmūlaga, shiigelile abūlagwe nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wakūbūlaga ntugo gwa bangī, shiigelile alīpe; ī mihayo īkūyūja mu nzīla ya būpanga kūlwa būpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nūūlū munhū ūnemehaja ng'wiye, ūmo wang'wītīlaga shiigelile nang'hwe ītwe gīko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iguha kūlw'iguha, liso kūlwa liso, na lino kūlwa lino. Ūmo wanemehagījaga dūhū ū ng'wiye, nū wei akūlemehajiwa gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūbūlaga ntugo gwa bangī shiigelile alīpe ntugo; alīyo ū wa kūbūlaga munhū, ū ng'wene akūbūlagwa nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiigelile mubize na shilagīlo sha mbika īmò kūlwa banhū bose, babize bageni nūūlū bana byalwa. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūbawīla a banhū kūmfunya ū nsondagūji, būntwala hanze ya ng'hambī kūjūmponda mawe. A Baisilaeli bīīta gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla ū Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
